r/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         No - before I get into the office, I'm going to text the guy who I work with, and ask him if the coast is clear. After he gives me the all clear, then I'll head to my desk.<br/>", "time": "32000", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le16ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Wow. Do you think my employees think that way about me?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         I wouldn't be surprised. People respect you, which is important. Sometimes with respect comes a little fear ...<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     I don't want to be a terror! That's got to be dreadful for the staff.", "time": "46500", "id": 4, "image": "engenn7le16ob06re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le16ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le16ob06re2img01.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}